  "body": "Is it possible to add an extra boolean parameter `spaceAsPlus` which defaults to false to [UTF-8 percent-encode algorithm](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#utf-8-percent-encode)? It calls the not exported [percent-encode after encoding algorithm](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#string-percent-encode-after-encoding) which has the `spaceAsPlus` parameter. For our use case, we want to set `spaceAsPlus` to true when using [=UTF-8 percent-encode=] algorithm, which is not supported for the algorithm's current defination. ",
